# Public Engagement & Outreach

Communicating scientific research and broadening access to STEM fields is central to my academic mission. I engage in community education, open-access curriculum creation, and scientific communication.

## Community Initiatives

### STEM Youth Workshop Series
*Coordinator & Lead Instructor (2024–Present)*
- Organized bi-monthly coding and robotics workshops for local high school students.
- Designed accessible curriculum modules focused on introductory web development and data literacy.

### Open Science Communication
*Writer & Seminar Organizer*
- Host public panel discussions translating emerging academic research for non-technical community audiences.
- Publish accessible summaries of technical papers to lower barriers to entry for early-career researchers.

